## What to deliver

Sequence the cue up operation by operation — tempo and meter, the tracks and their
notes, the mix — rendering to check the piano-roll and waveform as you go, until it
captures the Meridian's identity: a sleek, luminous, precise cue, elegant and
agile, stereo, within the 30000 ms cap and loopable. When you are satisfied, stop:
the recorded `actions.json` is your finished submission.
